## Original Content
Chinese President Xi Jinping on Monday afternoon held a welcome ceremony for King of the Hashemite Kingdom of Jordan Abdullah II ibn Al Hussein, who is on a state visit to China, at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing.

## Summary
Chinese President Xi Jinping held a welcome ceremony for King Abdullah II of Jordan at the Great Hall of the People in Beijing. King Abdullah II is on a state visit to China, highlighting diplomatic relations between the two countries.

## Key Points
- Xi Jinping welcomed King Abdullah II at a ceremony in Beijing.
- The event was held at the Great Hall of the People.
- King Abdullah II is visiting China on a state visit.
- The ceremony underscores China-Jordan diplomatic ties.


